le":0,"stats":[11,13,73,78,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[11,13,73,78,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[11,13,73,78,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[11,13,73,78,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[11,13,73,78,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1019","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[11,13,73,78,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"15350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10957","city":"CS1030","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[11,13,73,78,80,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"15350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1026805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉末年著名的儒士，缪袭之父，以学识渊博和至孝闻名。一生博览经传，在当时享有很高的声望。朝廷先后征召为博士，六次征召入公府为官，都未应召赴任。汉献帝在长安时，公卿大臣举荐名儒，推举缪斐出任侍中，依然没有接受。据传缪斐事亲至孝，父亲患病时曾“尽夜叩头，不寝不食”。因其淡泊名利、终身不仕的品格，时人赞誉为“素车白马缪文雅”。晚年避居海滨隐居，终老不仕。","tc":"東漢末年著名的儒士，繆襲之父，以學識淵博和至孝聞名。一生博覽經傳，在當時享有很高的聲望。朝廷先后征召為博士，六次征召入公府為官，都未應召赴任。漢獻帝在長安時，公卿大臣舉薦名儒，推舉繆斐出任侍中，依然沒有接受。據傳繆斐事親至孝，父親患病時曾“盡夜叩頭，不寢不食”。因其淡泊名利、終身不仕的品格，時人贊譽為“素車白馬繆文雅”。晚年避居海濱隱居，終老不仕。","en":"A renowned Confucian scholar of the late Eastern Han dynasty and the father of Miao Xi, celebrated for his profound erudition and utmost filial piety. Having extensively studied the classics throughout his life, he enjoyed immense Renown in his era. The imperial court repeatedly summoned him to serve as an Erudite (Boshi) and six times to serve in the offices of the Excellencies, but he declined every summons. When Emperor Xian of Han was in Chang'an, high officials recommended eminent Confucian scholars and nominated Miao Fei to serve as an Attendant Gentleman (Shizhong), but he still refused to accept. It is said that Miao Fei was exceptionally filial to his parents, when his father fell ill, he ‘kowtowed through the night without sleep or food.’ Due to his indifference to fame and fortune and his lifelong refusal to hold office, contemporaries praised him as ‘Miao Wenya of the plain chariot and white Horse.’ In his twilight years, he lived in seclusion by the seacoast and never entered officialdom until the end of his days.","jp":"後漢末期の著名な儒士で、繆襲の父。博学多才かつ至孝の持ち主として知られた。生涯にわたり経伝を広く修め、当時は非常に高い名声を誇った。朝廷から博士として召し出され、公府からも六度にわたり招聘されたが、いずれも応じることはなかった。献帝が長安にいた際、公卿大臣らが名高い儒学者を推挙し、繆斐を侍中に任じようとしたが、それも受け入れなかった。繆斐は親孝行に尽くしたと伝えられ、父が病を患った際には「夜通しぬかずき、寝食を忘れた」という。名利に淡白で生涯仕官しなかったその高潔さから、当時の人々より「素車白馬の繆文雅」と称えられた。晩年は海辺に隠棲し、最後まで官に就くことなくその生涯を終えた。","kr":"동한 말기의 저명한 유학자이자 묘습의 부친으로, 해박한 학식과 지극한 효성으로 널리 알려졌다. 평생 경전을 두루 섭렵하여 당대에 높은 명성을 떨쳤다. 조정에서 박사로 징소하고 여섯 차례나 공부(公府)의 벼슬로 불렀으나, 모두 응하지 않고 나아가지 않았다. 헌제가 장안에 있을 때 공경대신들이 이름난 유학자를 천거하며 묘비를 시중으로 추천하였으나, 이 또한 받아들이지 않았다. 전해지는 바에 따르면 묘비는 어버이를 지극한 효성으로 섬겨 부친이 병환을 앓자 '밤새도록 머리를 조아리며 잠도 자지 않고 먹지도 않았다'고 한다. 명리를 탐하지 않고 평생 벼슬길에 나아가지 않는 고결한 품성 덕분에 당시 사람들은 그를 '소거백마 묘문아(素車白馬 繆文雅)'라 칭송하였다. 말년에는 바닷가로 거처를 옮겨 은거하였으며, 끝내 벼슬을 하지 않고 여생을 마쳤다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1033315","remark":"","surname":"缪","surnameTc":"繆","surnameEn":"Miao","surnameJp":"繆","surnameKr":"묘","surnameOther":"","name":"斐","nameTc":"斐","nameEn":"Fei","nameJp":"斐","nameKr":"비","nameOther":"","word":"文雅","wordTc":"文雅","wordEn":"Wenya","wordJp":"文雅","wordKr":"문아","wordOther":"","icon":"缪斐","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"0","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1019","gender":"0","rule":"11","force":"13","wise":"73","politics":"78","charm":"80","will":"81","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"1/1/11/1/11/73/51/2","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4600","battleSoulPoint":"4200","debateSoulPoint":"4900","strategy":"1007015","strategy2":"1001305","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/3/0/0/0/0/4/0/1/1/3/2/0/1/1/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"13","loyalty":"0","reputation":"15350","evaluate":"6000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"157","show":"184","death":"216","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","hel